---
import TechnicalFigure from './TechnicalFigure.astro';
---
<section id="actuation" class="rocket-section rocket-actuation" aria-labelledby="rocket-actuation-heading">
  <div class="rocket-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">GROUND ACTUATION</p><h2 id="rocket-actuation-heading">turning commands into motion.</h2><p>Two photographed ground states show the airbrake mechanism before and after extension.</p></div>
  <div class="rocket-actuation-pair" aria-label="Airbrake retracted and extended ground comparison">
    <TechnicalFigure src="/images/projects/rocket-airbrake/media/airbrake-ground-retracted.webp" alt="Airbrake mechanism on the workbench with its brake plates retracted." caption="Retracted · ground position" width={423} height={676}/>
    <span class="rocket-actuation-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    <TechnicalFigure src="/images/projects/rocket-airbrake/media/airbrake-ground-extended.webp" alt="Airbrake mechanism on the workbench with a brake plate extended." caption="Extended · ground position" width={423} height={676}/>
  </div>
</section>
